Subject: [PATCH 1/3] fill dl-a: statClose_rejectBlocksL

Block rejection sampling is firstHit on Fin (2^k) of the numbers read from the
blocks; the block reader pushes uniform coins to uniform draws (restriction along
the injective block layout, then curry and bitsEquiv), so statClose_firstHit
transfers by StatClose.comp_pushesUniform and StatClose.map Fin.val.

